    "reviews": "\u201cTime Recoil is one of those games that does a single element exceedingly well to the detriment of everything else, and that\u2019s not necessarily bad.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gaming Trend<br><br>\u201cAll the game mechanics give incentive to play well and enter a great flow that so many games fail to achieve.\u201d<br>Great \u2013 Save or Quit<br><br>\u201cSo I\u2019ll tell you this right away, if you enjoyed games like Hotline: Miami and Mr. Shifty you will definitely love this game as well, it brings something new to the table but takes the proven twin-stick formula and kicks it up a notch.\u201d<br>8.3 \u2013 Reviews For Gamers<br>",
